WEBVTT

00:00:02.530 --> 00:00:04.930
Good morning, everyone.

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:13.030
<i>This is a Level E-3 emergency.</i>

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:14.790
<i>This ship is in free fall.</i>

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:15.450
Nai! Rem!

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:19.000
Get inside. And hurry.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.330
Rem?

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:22.040
Meeting you...

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:24.230
...has brought me so much joy!

00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:25.230
Rem!

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:32.690
REM!

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:47.800
A brilliant success! I finally did it!

00:00:53.290 --> 00:00:55.050
You're my accomplice...

00:00:57.030 --> 00:00:59.790
Vash.

00:01:02.780 --> 00:01:05.030
<i>There's nothing on this planet.</i>

00:01:05.030 --> 00:01:06.560
<i>No water. No food.</i>

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:11.820
<i>Without plants, our ancestors 
would have gone straight to heaven.</i>

00:01:11.820 --> 00:01:16.110
<i>"We would've been better off 
that way"? Right on!</i>

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:21.100
<i>Was surviving in this hellscape
really a stroke of good fortune?</i>

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:24.220
<i>Or should we be pitied for our bad luck?</i>

00:01:24.220 --> 00:01:26.330
<i>Anyway, here's a tune...</i>

00:02:58.180 --> 00:03:02.450
<i>Late last night, two dangerous criminals 
 escaped the May City Prison!</i>

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:08.340
<i>These criminals, known as the Nebraskas, 
were convicted of 69 counts of manslaughter</i>

00:03:08.340 --> 00:03:12.500
<i>and twelve counts of attempted murder.</i>

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:14.060
That's nearby!

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:15.610
How disturbing.

00:03:15.610 --> 00:03:18.010
So what you're saying is that...

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:22.750
you're <i>not</i> the person running around 
stealing plants all over the planet.

00:03:23.780 --> 00:03:28.370
And the real culprit is your twin brother
 who looks exactly like you.

00:03:30.930 --> 00:03:34.360
A different man with the same face, huh?

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:36.670
Sounds a bit too convenient.

00:03:36.670 --> 00:03:38.710
There's no proof, either.

00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:42.280
In other words, we can't just 
take you at your word.

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:47.250
You can't cry your way out of this.

00:03:48.570 --> 00:03:51.560
So, this brother... "Knives" was it?

00:03:51.560 --> 00:03:54.650
What does he want with the plants anyway?

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:57.300
Is it about money? Or maybe honor?

00:03:57.760 --> 00:04:00.080
Could it be revenge?

00:04:05.880 --> 00:04:07.540
What's up, kiddo?

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:08.850
Are those for me?

00:04:11.190 --> 00:04:14.410
Thanks, Tonis. I'll take good care of them.

00:04:15.140 --> 00:04:17.400
Oh, what a heartwarming scene...

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:19.040
Like you're even looking.

00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:20.730
Is he gone?

00:04:20.730 --> 00:04:21.730
Not yet.

00:04:21.730 --> 00:04:22.990
Tonis!

00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:26.560
How many times do I have to tell you 
not to bring Worms into the diner?!

00:04:27.440 --> 00:04:29.500
You stay outta here for a while!

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:31.780
You didn't have to go that far.

00:04:32.510 --> 00:04:34.100
Now then...

00:04:40.930 --> 00:04:43.470
Real sorry about this, Vash.

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:51.230
#02 The Running Man

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:01.400
Don't let him get away!

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:07.470
This way!

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:09.870
He's here!

00:05:19.760 --> 00:05:20.780
Over here!

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:28.850
Oh dear.

00:05:28.850 --> 00:05:29.930
Got him!

00:05:32.980 --> 00:05:33.970
Vash!

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:36.640
Now!

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:37.710
Yeah, yeah.

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:47.890
What the hell is going on?

00:05:47.890 --> 00:05:48.920
You're heavy...

00:05:48.920 --> 00:05:50.670
That's what I'd like to know.

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:02.250
What's wrong with this hunk of junk?!

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:05.040
All the cars out here are like this.

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:08.750
For crying out loud! I can't have 
my son turning stupid on me!

00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:12.780
If you wanted better stuff, 
you should've gone to a big city like JuLai.

00:06:12.780 --> 00:06:14.700
I think I will, thank you very much.

00:06:14.700 --> 00:06:19.130
Right after we catch this loser 
and get our six million!

00:06:19.130 --> 00:06:22.360
Seriously, what a dumb face...

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:26.740
He's got to be an easy catch, Gofsef!

00:06:28.660 --> 00:06:31.370
Why'd they use <i>this</i> photo?

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:32.860
Is that really the issue?

00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:36.410
So those journalists were part of his gang?

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:38.910
Whatever. We'll just catch them all.

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:41.490
We can demand a higher bounty for 'em.

00:06:42.280 --> 00:06:45.000
Great idea, trying to save this guy.

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:46.490
I'm sorry.

00:06:46.490 --> 00:06:49.840
If you could actually put up a fight, 
this would be a lot easier.

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:52.190
What? You wanna have a shoot-out?

00:06:52.190 --> 00:06:53.480
Come on...

00:06:53.480 --> 00:06:56.810
Don't tell me you forgot 
to load up on ammo again.

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:59.030
No, I made sure I brought plenty today.

00:06:59.030 --> 00:07:03.150
But I'd rather not use them.
Bullets are pretty pricey.

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:05.090
You could get locked up!

00:07:05.090 --> 00:07:07.970
But one bullet is worth 
two whole slices of pizza!

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:10.290
We're as good as dead.

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:12.360
Hey, hey! Come on!

00:07:12.360 --> 00:07:15.060
We just have to get out of town, right?

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:20.870
I see him!

00:07:21.430 --> 00:07:22.850
Hey, someone saw him!

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:23.870
Found him!

00:07:23.870 --> 00:07:24.690
Come on!

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:28.980
That's a dead end!

00:07:31.140 --> 00:07:33.650
Damn it, he got us.

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:39.060
Find him!

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:50.530
Vash.

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:52.620
Don't make this any harder.

00:07:57.200 --> 00:07:59.830
I'm looking forward to this. 
Aren't you, Gofsef?

00:08:04.350 --> 00:08:06.430
Looks like someone already caught him.

00:08:06.430 --> 00:08:07.420
What?!

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:11.580
Whatever! We'll steal him from them!

00:08:11.580 --> 00:08:13.250
Run them over!

00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:17.500
For real? You promised you'd 
let me go before we hit town!

00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:19.410
Shut him up, Gofsef.

00:08:23.300 --> 00:08:25.090
You idiot!

00:08:25.090 --> 00:08:27.790
Now who's going to drive this thing?!

00:08:31.300 --> 00:08:35.210
With the plant in this state, 
all we have to rely on is money.

00:08:35.210 --> 00:08:37.140
How can you be so heartless?!

00:08:37.610 --> 00:08:42.260
Who does this to someone who saved 
their town twice? It's unthinkable!

00:08:42.260 --> 00:08:44.480
I know that.

00:08:45.350 --> 00:08:47.550
I wouldn't dare if were just adults here.

00:08:48.010 --> 00:08:50.710
But we're mothers.

00:08:51.590 --> 00:08:54.970
I won't stand by while 
our kids get sick and starve.

00:08:55.710 --> 00:09:00.860
Sorry, Vash. If you need to lay the
 blame somewhere, call it bad luck.

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:11.490
Tonis!

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:25.080
You good?

00:09:25.080 --> 00:09:25.620
Yeah.

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:27.930
Tonis...

00:09:30.510 --> 00:09:34.110
<i>Power is justice! Power is truth!</i>

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:33.330
Vash?

00:09:34.110 --> 00:09:36.350
<i>There's no future for those who can't fight!</i>

00:09:36.350 --> 00:09:39.750
<i>Get out here, Vash the Stampede!</i>

00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:44.560
<i>We, the Hard Puncher Nebraskas, 
challenge you to a duel!</i>

00:09:44.940 --> 00:09:48.150
<i>Where are you, Vash the Stampede?!</i>

00:09:49.220 --> 00:09:50.110
Vash?

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:53.050
Stop! My six million!

00:09:56.540 --> 00:09:58.390
Hurry! After them!

00:09:58.390 --> 00:09:59.340
Wait... Hey!

00:10:09.280 --> 00:10:10.750
Go back to town!

00:10:11.070 --> 00:10:14.090
What about you?
They're going to mow you down!

00:10:14.090 --> 00:10:16.260
Don't think you can get away!

00:10:33.490 --> 00:10:35.960
Ugh, stop, you bastard!

00:10:35.960 --> 00:10:38.830
I can't have my son turning stupid!

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:41.580
Do it, Gofsef!

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:48.460
Now <i>that's</i> a punch.

00:10:50.640 --> 00:10:52.460
<i>I'll end you!</i>

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:54.400
<i>Get flattened!</i>

00:10:59.660 --> 00:11:01.180
You piece of junk!

00:11:07.880 --> 00:11:09.220
Did their engine stall?

00:11:10.430 --> 00:11:11.720
Beats me.

00:11:11.720 --> 00:11:12.310
Well...

00:11:18.590 --> 00:11:21.160
Stop running and fight us!

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:24.450
No thanks. I'm not a fan of pain.

00:11:25.400 --> 00:11:28.160
Have you no pride as a gunman?!

00:11:28.160 --> 00:11:29.870
Nope. None whatsoever.

00:11:31.420 --> 00:11:35.920
I hate cowards like you!

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:37.850
This whole planet is fighting for survival!

00:11:37.850 --> 00:11:41.520
Anyone who runs is bound 
to die like a sorry loser!

00:11:41.910 --> 00:11:45.860
But you, Stampede! How dare you?!

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:51.990
That had to hurt.

00:11:57.650 --> 00:12:01.280
I can't have my son turning stupid!

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:03.390
Take it easy!

00:12:03.390 --> 00:12:05.780
You insult me!

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:08.120
Gofsef.

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:09.970
This is no laughing matter!

00:12:09.970 --> 00:12:12.380
You're turning into a coward like him.

00:12:12.380 --> 00:12:14.700
You shame the Nebraska name!

00:12:14.700 --> 00:12:17.090
Damn it, damn it!

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:20.760
Without that cash, 
we're going back to prison!

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:22.940
Oh, I know.

00:12:33.970 --> 00:12:36.320
I agree with that man.

00:12:36.320 --> 00:12:40.760
You think you're so clever, 
running away like this?

00:12:44.160 --> 00:12:47.030
How totally lame.

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:52.520
It's not an act of kindness.
You're just running away from pain.

00:12:52.520 --> 00:12:55.100
That's enough, newbie.

00:12:55.100 --> 00:12:56.110
Fine.

00:12:57.210 --> 00:12:59.880
You might be right that I'm too timid.

00:13:01.250 --> 00:13:03.970
But is that such a terrible thing?

00:13:05.560 --> 00:13:08.020
Is fighting everything head-on so important?

00:13:10.200 --> 00:13:13.340
Even if it gets someone killed?

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:22.800
Don't let them get in! Fire!

00:13:30.250 --> 00:13:31.120
Mom!

00:13:37.070 --> 00:13:39.670
How did we miss this?

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:43.220
There's something <i>much</i> more valuable here.

00:13:43.590 --> 00:13:46.270
A real treasure!

00:13:49.170 --> 00:13:52.520
<i>Intruders at the factory! We need backup now!</i>

00:13:52.520 --> 00:13:53.630
<i>We need backup—</i>

00:13:57.820 --> 00:13:59.010
Vash?

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:01.960
Get in, newbie!

00:14:01.960 --> 00:14:03.190
Okay!

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:16.360
Power is justice!

00:14:17.890 --> 00:14:21.140
Power is truth!

00:14:23.530 --> 00:14:26.590
There's no future for those who can't fight!

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:33.740
Rosa! We can't shoot or we might hit the plant.

00:14:33.740 --> 00:14:35.630
You folks stay here.

00:14:35.630 --> 00:14:36.480
Rosa!

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:43.900
You give back that plant!

00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:58.250
Wha?!

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:01.250
Stampede!

00:15:05.140 --> 00:15:08.430
What are you doing back here, you coward?

00:15:09.410 --> 00:15:15.270
Don't tell me you did all that running to
 draw our attention away from the plant.

00:15:15.270 --> 00:15:21.990
Eh, who cares? 
Now we can finally fight head-on.

00:15:23.700 --> 00:15:25.190
Gofsef!

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:42.130
Why won't you draw your gun?!

00:15:42.130 --> 00:15:43.790
Draw!

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:46.000
What gives?!

00:15:46.860 --> 00:15:48.910
Why won't you shoot?

00:15:48.910 --> 00:15:50.500
Right back at you!

00:15:50.500 --> 00:15:54.330
A single round for this baby 
costs a boatload! I'm saving up!

00:15:54.330 --> 00:15:56.220
Don't make me say that out loud!

00:15:56.220 --> 00:15:57.940
I guess we've all got problems, huh?

00:15:57.940 --> 00:15:58.810
Shut up!

00:15:58.810 --> 00:16:01.200
I'll show you.

00:16:01.200 --> 00:16:02.420
Gofsef!

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:07.900
Weapons...

00:16:08.430 --> 00:16:10.520
are made for fighting!

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:18.220
Vash...

00:16:18.220 --> 00:16:18.950
Vash!

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:26.340
Do you get it now?!

00:16:26.340 --> 00:16:29.430
There's no future for those who don't fight!

00:16:29.890 --> 00:16:31.430
That was close.

00:16:31.430 --> 00:16:32.550
Wha?!

00:16:34.120 --> 00:16:36.430
Come on, can you back off?

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:39.460
I really don't want to fight anyone.

00:16:39.460 --> 00:16:42.680
That's the attitude that pisses me off!

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:46.830
If you take the plant, 
this town won't make it.

00:16:47.710 --> 00:16:50.370
You remember they're after your head, right?

00:16:50.370 --> 00:16:55.910
They're worse than regular villains 
for pretending to befriend you.

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:58.830
What value is there in trying to save them?

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:00.890
There's no reason <i>not</i> to help them.

00:17:01.530 --> 00:17:03.820
They tricked you!

00:17:04.430 --> 00:17:06.280
I don't mind.

00:17:06.280 --> 00:17:08.360
Don't you have any pride?

00:17:09.260 --> 00:17:12.860
These people were kind to me.

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:17.200
So I want to save them. That's all.

00:17:20.930 --> 00:17:22.600
In that case...

00:17:24.570 --> 00:17:36.530
Fight!

00:17:42.290 --> 00:17:43.790
Seriously?

00:17:46.970 --> 00:17:48.380
I want to help.

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:50.630
That includes you.

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:52.230
This guy...

00:17:53.780 --> 00:17:56.320
Whose side are you on?

00:18:03.060 --> 00:18:05.750
Oh no! Run, Gofsef!

00:18:11.810 --> 00:18:13.180
Gofsef!

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:18.120
You idiot!

00:18:19.590 --> 00:18:22.260
Gof...sef...

00:18:28.770 --> 00:18:30.030
You're almost there!

00:18:32.340 --> 00:18:33.460
Gof!

00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:36.310
Gofsef!

00:18:48.290 --> 00:18:51.120
I've... got you!

00:18:51.120 --> 00:18:52.750
Gofsef! Gofsef!

00:18:59.300 --> 00:19:00.440
Rosa...

00:19:05.450 --> 00:19:08.380
H-He's my darling son...

00:19:11.310 --> 00:19:12.560
Rosa!

00:19:12.560 --> 00:19:15.010
Please! I need your help!

00:19:17.890 --> 00:19:20.380
You give back that plant.

00:19:20.380 --> 00:19:21.540
Yes, ma'am.

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:25.290
Come on, everyone!

00:19:26.560 --> 00:19:31.020
One, two! One, two!

00:19:31.810 --> 00:19:36.620
One, two! One, two!

00:19:37.440 --> 00:19:39.630
One, two!

00:19:39.630 --> 00:19:41.970
Gofsef!

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:46.050
I'm so glad! I'm so, so glad!

00:19:47.800 --> 00:19:49.890
Gofsef!

00:19:59.430 --> 00:20:01.470
Vash the Stampede...

00:20:02.850 --> 00:20:04.150
What a weirdo.

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:10.310
Let's go, Gofsef.

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:12.990
Take it easy.

00:20:14.320 --> 00:20:15.460
Hold it.

00:20:17.870 --> 00:20:19.890
There's plenty of booze to go around.

00:20:19.890 --> 00:20:22.030
Just for today, knock yourselves out!

00:20:25.920 --> 00:20:29.580
Drinking at this hour? 
These folks really are terrible.

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:32.250
Don't be shy.

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:33.960
I don't drink.

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:35.130
What?

00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:48.880
You know what?

00:20:48.880 --> 00:20:53.510
You gotta lay off the booze and smokes
or that stuff's gonna get to you!

00:20:55.550 --> 00:20:58.110
Hey, are you listenin' to me?

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:17.780
Not even a goodbye?

00:21:18.270 --> 00:21:20.030
They'll miss you.

00:21:20.440 --> 00:21:22.690
I don't like overstaying.

00:21:23.110 --> 00:21:24.680
No, that's not it.

00:21:24.680 --> 00:21:28.020
You couldn't stay in one place for long 
even if you wanted to.

00:21:31.690 --> 00:21:34.580
Just who are you running from?

00:21:34.580 --> 00:21:37.610
Wait... You told me his name this morning.

00:21:38.970 --> 00:21:41.610
Millions Knives.

00:21:48.100 --> 00:21:49.550
Vash! Roberto!

00:21:49.550 --> 00:21:50.540
What's going on?

00:21:51.070 --> 00:21:53.230
What is this stuff?!

00:21:55.340 --> 00:21:57.990
Lost technology?!

00:22:05.880 --> 00:22:07.410
Gofsef!
